I like her a lot, actually.

271
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:08,750
You do?

272
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:09,960
Yeah.

273
00:18:10,460 --> 00:18:12,750
Your timing couldn't be better.

274
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,800
She's not my girlfriend anymore.

275
00:18:15,010 --> 00:18:16,130
What?

276
00:18:16,670 --> 00:18:20,840
- Yeah, she broke up with me.     - When?

277
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:23,260
Just now, after acting class.

278
00:18:23,510 --> 00:18:27,270
I thought she was doing some scene, so I let people watch.

279
00:18:29,690 --> 00:18:32,730
Man, I am so sorry. Are you okay?

280
00:18:32,980 --> 00:18:37,240
I've been better, but I'm all right. So you like her?

281
00:18:37,490 --> 00:18:40,030
Yes, but I don't have to.

282
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:42,950
No, it's okay.

283
00:18:43,830 --> 00:18:45,830
- Yeah?     - Yeah.

284
00:18:46,290 --> 00:18:49,410
You know why? Because you came to me first.

285
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:55,040
I thought that would be the best thing to do.

286
00:18:56,050 --> 00:18:58,840
You might have your work cut out for you.

287
00:18:59,050 --> 00:19:03,930
When I talked to her, I got the feeling she's into some other guy.

288
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:08,980
See, that's actually what I wanted to talk to you about.

289
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:12,980
I think I know who the other guy is.

290
00:19:13,190 --> 00:19:14,440
Who?

291
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:17,610
It's me.

292
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:19,570
I'm the other guy.

293
00:19:20,070 --> 00:19:21,530
What?

294
00:19:22,740 --> 00:19:27,370
When you were late last night, Kathy and I got to talking...

295
00:19:27,580 --> 00:19:30,330
...and one thing led to another, and...

296
00:19:30,540 --> 00:19:32,960
And what? Did you sleep with her?

297
00:19:33,170 --> 00:19:34,790
No, I just kissed her.

298
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,090
What? That's even worse.

299
00:19:38,050 --> 00:19:40,760
- How is that worse?     - It's the same.

300
00:19:41,930 --> 00:19:45,340
There's nothing I could do. I'm in love with her.

301
00:19:45,550 --> 00:19:46,550
Who cares?

302
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:49,850
You went behind my back? I'd never do that to you.

303
00:19:50,100 --> 00:19:53,390
I have no excuses. I was totally over the line.

304
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:58,440
You're so far past the line, that you can't even see the line.

305
00:19:58,690 --> 00:20:00,190
It's a dot to you.

306
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:01,900
Yes.

307
00:20:02,070 --> 00:20:06,160
Yes, right. And I feel horrible. You have to believe me.

308
00:20:06,490 --> 00:20:08,830
Is that why you bought all this?

309
00:20:10,620 --> 00:20:11,830
You know what?

310
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:14,500
I will not watch your TV.

311
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:16,580
I won't listen to your stereo.

312
00:20:16,790 --> 00:20:21,090
And there's a loaf in the new bread maker I won't eat. Know why?

313
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,260
Because...

314
00:20:22,470 --> 00:20:25,010
It's all tainted with your betrayal.

315
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:31,470
This apartment is empty to me. I'm not happy about you, either.

316
00:20:37,860 --> 00:20:39,820
And just so you know...

317
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:42,650
...I made that bread for you.

318
00:20:57,250 --> 00:21:00,040
Oh, my God. He's totally lost it.

319
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:03,260
What?

320
00:21:03,550 --> 00:21:06,800
Phoebe. This cannot get any worse.

321
00:21:07,050 --> 00:21:10,100
Rats in the basement are hanging themselves.

322
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:21,770
Thank you. Thanks.

323
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:26,820
I lost it.

324
00:21:29,030 --> 00:21:30,450
I won't play anymore.

325
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:33,700
Would you... Can you finish my set?

326
00:21:34,580 --> 00:21:36,040
After that? Yeah.

327
00:21:38,330 --> 00:21:40,540
No, I mean, if I can help.

328
00:21:46,170 --> 00:21:48,550
Like I could lose it.

329
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:54,180
- What?     - I played bad on purpose, guys.

330
00:21:54,390 --> 00:21:55,810
- Oh.     - Oh.

331
00:21:56,600 --> 00:21:58,850
You were playing bad this whole time.

332
00:21:59,060 --> 00:22:00,520
Just that last song.

